 rom mid-evening. Wrap up warm\; it's worth it. Up to ~150/hr under perfect
  skies (realistically a fraction of that). 🌕 Moon 97% lit: the moonligh
 t will drown the fainter meteors\; look for fireballs.\n\nStatus: 🟡 Est
 imated (pattern-based or provisional\; check before booking)\nPeak night s
 hown\; the night either side is usually worthwhile too.\nOfficial info: ht
 tps://www.imo.net/resources/calendar/
