 he sea is a dream photo\; head to a west-facing coast like Pembrokeshire o
 r Cornwall.\n\nStatus: ✅ Confirmed\nMaximum ~16:40 GMT\; the Sun is very
  low\, so you need a clear south-west horizon. Use eclipse glasses.\nLocal
  start: Wed 26 Jan 16:40 (GMT). Your calendar shows it in your own time zo
 ne.\nOfficial info: https://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/in/uk
